\[f''\left(\frac{1}{4}\right) = \frac{16}{\left(1 - 2\cdot \frac{1}{4}\right)^3} + \frac{2}{\left(\frac{1}{4}\right)^3} = \frac{16}{\left(1 - \frac{1}{2}\right)^3} + \frac{2}{\frac{1}{64}} = \frac{16}{\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^3} + 128 = \frac{16}{\frac{1}{8}} + 128 = 16 \cdot 8 + 128 = 128 + 128 = 256 > 0.\]
Since $f''\left(\frac{1}{4}\right) > 0$, we have a minimum at $b = \frac{1}{4}$.
